{"products":[{"id":11699980206421,"title":"ChargeBridge Evaluation Kit MCS [PN: CB-EVAL-MCS-KIT]","handle":"chargebridge-mcs-evaluation-kit-evse-side-pn-cb-eval-mcs-kit","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChargeBridge Evaluation Kit MCS – Breakout Board for Megawatt Charging (EVSE and EV side)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cspan data-start-index=\"2792\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2859\"\u003eThe starting point for MCS development. This kit combines the ChargeBridge MCS module with our breakout board, which makes all module interfaces accessible via convenient connectors. The module runs in either EVSE or EV mode, so the same kit can act as the charger or the vehicle. Evaluate MCS communication and control together with EVerest before you design your own controller or test setup.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2859\"\u003e\n\u003cspan data-start-index=\"3141\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"3142\"\u003e\u003cb data-start-index=\"3142\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEVSE or EV Side:\u003c\/strong\u003e One kit for both sides of the MCS connection. Use it as charging station or as vehicle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMCS Signalling:\u003c\/strong\u003e Charge Enable (CE) and Insertion Detection (ID) per IEC 61851-23-3, connected directly to the charging cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCommunication:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10BASE-T1S Single Pair Ethernet per ISO 15118-10, with ISO 15118-20 and mutually authenticated TLS 1.3 (in combination with EVerest)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEthernet or USB connection to Linux host\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInterfaces:\u003c\/strong\u003e Full access to CAN (for power supplies), RS485 (for insulation monitors\/meters), UART, 3x relay drivers, temperature measurements, emergency I\/O and GPIOs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLab Ready:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect for desk setups, HIL test benches, or as a reference design for custom carrier boards\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin-Compatible:\u003c\/strong\u003e Same M.2 footprint as the CCS ChargeBridge modules. Move from CCS to MCS by swapping the module, without redesigning the baseboard.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for the ChargeBridge Module (M.2) and seamless EVerest integration.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDC Capability:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enables testing of DC charging sequences up to 1000V when connected to external HV components.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12V-24V supply voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-start-index=\"3566\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"\u003eDocumentation: \u003ca rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/link.pionix.com\/chargebridge-demo-docs\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps:\/\/link.pionix.com\/chargebridge-demo-docs\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-start-index=\"3566\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\