ta-start-index=\"1852\" class=\"paragraph normal ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cb\u003eChargeBridge AC Evaluation Board – Development Kit for AC Charging\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAccelerate your AC charging station development. The ChargeBridge AC Evaluation Board is a fully populated evaluation board designed for Evaluation of ChargeBridge and EVerest for Classic AC Chargers as well as \"Satellite Architectures.\" It allows you to control a charging point via an external compute unit (e.g., Linux Host with EVerest), making it ideal for prototyping and testing.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eApplication:\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e Development of single-phase or three-phase AC charging systems (up to 400V).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eArchitecture:\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e Reference Board to start to develop you next generation AC Charger.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eConnectivity:\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e Seamless connection to the host via Ethernet or USB.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cb\u003eCompatibility:\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e Designed for the ChargeBridge Module (M.2) and seamless EVerest integration.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eIntegrated Control:\u003c\/b\u003e Includes relays control, CP\/PP interfaces, and support for ISO 15118-2\/Plug \u0026amp; Charge (when used with EVerest).\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ng-star-inserted\" data-start-index=\"2640\"\u003eDocumentation: \u00